The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:<span style="font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;
font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
