mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Arboricultural Impact Assessment, Design Access and
Heritage Statement, Schedule of Materials, 628/1, 628/11, 628/12, &nbsp;628/13, Location Plan.</span>

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(11, 118, 159);&quot;&gt;Prior to the commencement of construction works:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:191&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0B769F;
mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:191&quot;&gt;A)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:191&quot;&gt; A detailed
landscaping scheme shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local
Planning Authority. The scheme shall include:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;A
     landscape masterplan;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;Hard
     and soft landscaping details;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;Existing
     and proposed site levels;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;Planting
     plans (at a scale of not less than 1:100);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;Schedules
     of plants, including species, plant sizes, container sizes (at the time of
     planting), and proposed numbers/densities;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;A
     written specification of planting and cultivation works;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;Details
     of all hard surfacing materials; and&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:#0B769F;mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:
     191;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;A
     landscape implementation programme, including the timing of the works.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0B769F;
mso-themecolor:accent4;mso-themeshade:191&quot;&gt;B)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(11, 118, 159);&quot;&gt; The approved
landscaping scheme shall be implemented in accordance with the approved
programme. Any trees, shrubs or plants which, within five years of planting,
are removed, die, become seriously damaged or diseased shall be replaced during
the next planting season with others of similar size and species, unless
otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;i&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
